Revision history for perl-critic-policy-prohibitunusedimports

1.003 2026-11-21 TEODESIAN
    - Never report an import of import or unimport, as in
      use Exporter qw{import}.  perl calls them when another file uses
      the package, so no call to them is written.

1.002 2026-11-20 TEODESIAN
    - Add Test::NoWarnings, Test2::Plugin::NoWarnings and Mojo::Base to the
      built-in exempt list.  Each works through its import: the first two
      check the warnings of the whole test, and Mojo::Base takes flags that
      turn on features rather than name symbols.  Every distribution that
      used them had to list them in allow.

1.001 2026-09-03 TEODESIAN
    - Ad 're' to the default exempt list

1.000 2026-09-02 TEODESIAN
    - Initial Release
